            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. For the purpose of voluntary deductions for Public Employees Organized for Political and Legislative Equality (PEOPLE), fees charged to AFSCME or employees shall not exceed the actual costs incurred by the University to establish such deductions.",
            "block_bbox": [
